00:01:59.866 --> 00:02:02.733
The erosion of the place feels very,
very spectacular.

00:02:02.733 --> 00:02:05.166
"A lot of waterfalls.
" That's what this place looks like.

00:02:05.166 --> 00:02:07.933
It's really hard to get there. As you can see,
basically.

00:02:07.933 --> 00:02:09.133
Right in the middle

00:02:09.133 --> 00:02:10.600
