and then I found this side.

00:02:21.033 --> 00:02:22.900
Transportation is really,
really bad. We'll have to charter a car.

00:02:22.900 --> 00:02:24.866
A chartered car is too
expensive for me alone.

00:02:24.866 --> 00:02:27.233
So, since we rarely go
with a tour, let's

00:02:27.233 --> 00:02:29.233
see if we're going with
a tour this time.

00:02:29.233 --> 00:02:31.533
It should be convenient
because we were

00:02:31.533 --> 00:02:33.033
taken care of all day yesterday.

00:02:33.033 --> 00:02:34.666
The last time I was in Indonesia

00:02:34.666 --> 00:02:37.000
was 18 years ago.

00:02:37.000 --> 00:02:38.733
The place on the left
is called Banda Aceh.

00:02:38.733 --> 00:02:40.400
Indonesia is the worst
place in the tsunami.

00:02:40.400 --> 00:02:43.266
The Red Cross came here
to do school work,

00:02:43.266 --> 00:02:46.033
sort of reconstruction and education.

00:02:46.033 --> 00:02:47.966
Sevu Falls is out of here,

00:02:48.800 --> 00:02:50.033
dog! Crew!

00:02:52.100 --> 00:02:55.266
Currently, there's
an observation deck

00:02:55.266 --> 00:02:57.233
and a parking lot here
at Sauvoo Falls.

00:02:57.233 --> 00:02:58.566
Tumpak means there's

00:02:58.566 --> 00:02:59.733
a stack.

00:02:59.733 --> 00:03:02.366
（The waterfalls are more like it,

00:03:11.200 --> 00:03:15.666
but I've been here before.

00:03:15.666 --> 00:03:18.600
（"It doesn't look like this." "And then,
the more customers.)

00:03:18.600 --> 00:03:19.900
(The more he builds,

00:03:21.366 --> 00:03:22.366
